==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|electromagnetic spectra}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} The entire [[range]] of [[wavelength]]s of all known [[electromagnetic radiation]]s extending from [[gamma rays]], to [[X-ray]]s through [[visible light]], [[infrared]], to [[radio wave]]s.

